{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？一起去买给天羽学姐的礼物？」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4431", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。方便的话爱理也要一起来吗？」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1545", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可能来啊……话说你是不是脑袋出问题了？」", "text_idx": 140, "plain": "「怎么可能来啊……话说你是不是脑袋出问题了？」", "plain_idx": 140, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4432", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为啥啊？」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1546", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般来说你不会这么做的吧。为了一个男的……」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4433", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，果然是这样吗？\\n　我有时候也会觉得自己果然还是输了呀」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "「啊，果然是这样吗？　我有时候也会觉得自己果然还是输了呀」", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1547", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别说了。这只会让自己更难受吧」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4434", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的——」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1548", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「行吧。既然你喜欢让自己痛苦的话……」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4435", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，虽然我真的没有感觉痛苦就是了——」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1549", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在公园里抱着猫哭的，那到底是谁呀」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": "「在公园里抱着猫哭的，那到底是谁呀」", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4436", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也有过那样的事呢」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1550", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，没想到你居然还能笑着说出来」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4437", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是呀。只不过一个人想起来的时候说不定还会哭」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1551", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然如此——」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4438", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只不过，果然还是想让喜欢的人能够幸福呀」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": "「只不过，果然还是想让喜欢的人能够幸福呀」", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1552", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4439", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不知不觉就会想着……能为他做些什么」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1553", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你说的这些，我不明白」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4440", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那爱理，你要不也试试谈个恋爱？」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1554", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太蠢了，我就算了」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4441", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「越是这么想，等你有了喜欢的男生后就越是会黏着他呢～」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "「越是这么想，等你有了喜欢的男生后就越是会黏着他呢～」", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1555", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不会」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4442", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算了，怎样都好。我对那家伙之外的男性没有兴趣」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "「算了，怎样都好。我对那家伙之外的男性没有兴趣」", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1556", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「得单身一辈子咯～」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1557", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4443", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……只不过原来不是迷信呢」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4444", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，什么什么？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1558", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是说女性恋爱了会变得更有魅力」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4445", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗？」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1559", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎样都好了，真是的」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4446", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么吗，别自己突然间就明白了——」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1560", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我生气了，所以不想说。好好好，我也决定单身了」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "「我生气了，所以不想说。好好好，我也决定单身了」", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4447", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只不过——」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4448", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有能让爱理你着迷的男生的话……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那家伙，一定是世界最帅最厉害的男朋友了吧？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4449", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你呀，是不是因为恋爱，大脑变得有点轻飘飘的了？怎么可能会有那种男生」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "「你呀，是不是因为恋爱，大脑变得有点轻飘飘的了？怎么可能会有那种男生」", "plain_idx": 211, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4450", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么肯定吗？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是这么肯定」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4451", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是绝对不会恋爱的」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4452", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
